# Title: Findstr GPP Passwords
# ID: 91a2c315-9ee6-4052-a853-6f6a8238f90d
# Status: test
# Level: high
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2021-12-27
# Tags: attack.credential-access, attack.t1552.006
# Description: Look for the encrypted cpassword value within Group Policy Preference files on the Domain Controller. This value can be decrypted with gpp-decrypt.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((process.command_line:*cpassword* AND process.command_line:*\\sysvol\\* AND process.command_line:*.xml*)) AND (((process.executable:*\\find.exe OR process.executable:*\\findstr.exe)) OR ((process.pe.original_file_name:"FIND.EXE" OR process.pe.original_file_name:"FINDSTR.EXE"))))
